WEBVTT

00:01:55.139 --> 00:02:01.418
so I decided to do something almost
nobody in my town had ever done before:

00:02:01.778 --> 00:02:06.088
to leave my home town,
by myself, a single woman.

00:02:07.198 --> 00:02:09.498
Nobody wanted me to do that.

00:02:09.498 --> 00:02:15.328
I remember when I walked up to my mom
and told her, "Mama, I'm leaving."

00:02:16.608 --> 00:02:19.329
She looked at me and said,

00:02:19.329 --> 00:02:23.599
"Uma, I know how difficult it is
for you and even for me,

00:02:24.229 --> 00:02:26.690
and I cannot even support you openly,

00:02:27.160 --> 00:02:29.038
but I want you to have this."

00:02:29.708 --> 00:02:32.630
And she hands me a gold bangle.